window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I thought being Karma would be a cinch. I thought wrong.</p> <p>Turns out someone knows what I did to my jerk ex and his sleazy girlfriend. Or at least they left me a note telling me they knew, not that they bothered to sign it.</p> <p>When my ex is reported missing and cops from my old town start sniffing around, I know I'm in trouble.</p> <p>What's worse?</p> <p>I find a body outside my house. The town philanderer.</p> <p>Now everyone's giving me the side eye, including the man I had a crush on all those years ago, and rumors are flying, which jeopardizes my new job. To top it all off, I still don't know how to use my powers.</p> <p>I thought life was supposed to get easier as you got older?</p>"; 
